"For many years I tracked my weight with %(hdo_link)s, created by "
"%(walker_link)s. It kept working for a good while after his death, but in "
"March 2026 it finally stopped."
msgstr ""
"Per molti anni ho tenuto traccia del mio peso con %(hdo_link)s, creato da "
"%(walker_link)s. Ha continuato a funzionare a lungo dopo la sua morte, ma a "
"marzo 2026 si è fermato definitivamente."

# machine-translated
#, python-format
msgid ""
"I tried %(yadt_link)s as a replacement, but its interface wasn't for me. So "
"I vibe-coded my own version, and Kilo Tracker is the result. It's free for "
"anyone to use."
msgstr ""
"Ho provato %(yadt_link)s come sostituto, ma la sua interfaccia non faceva "
